    "detailed_description": "In this unique chat interactive game, your audience matters more than ever! Engage with the action by having your viewers typing commands in the chat, and watch as their decisions directly impact the on-screen gameplay. Will you march on the path to victory or have a wrench thrown in your plans? The choice is up to chat!<br><br>But beware, every adventure comes with risks. Viewers responsible might face consequences. It's a high-stakes challenge where skill, strategy, and a bit of mischief collide. Chatters can be timed out, banned, VIP'd and so much more! This game is built around taking your TikTok, YouTube, or Twitch stream to the next level!<br><br>Collaborate, compete, and share unforgettable moments together as we push the boundaries of interactive streaming!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/0dd7ac0b7ad447114192b3db70ad9ebd.avif?t=1738477316\" /></span><br><br>The game can be played by audiences of any size! As a streamer, take command and watch your chat have the time of their life right in front of your very eyes!<br><br>This game is meant to be a fun experience for both streamers and viewers that would like to more actively participate. The game is very community oriented and is meant to be fun for all. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/Peepoheart__1_.png?t=1738477316\" /></span><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udfae Engaging Gameplay: Type commands in the chat to influence the game in real-time and interact with the streamer on screen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/72cc8b4102e3fda8251cc887f03c0805.poster.avif?t=1738477316\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/72cc8b4102e3fda8251cc887f03c0805.webm?t=1738477316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/72cc8b4102e3fda8251cc887f03c0805.mp4?t=1738477316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>\ud83d\udd25 Viewer Impact: Your decisions directly affect the outcome, creating a truly interactive experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/aecd18900b60c7fd6e6ee4c4d5ef58eb.poster.avif?t=1738477316\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/aecd18900b60c7fd6e6ee4c4d5ef58eb.webm?t=1738477316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/aecd18900b60c7fd6e6ee4c4d5ef58eb.mp4?t=1738477316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>\u2694\ufe0f High-Stakes: Failure has consequences!</li></ul><br>Fantastic Music used with permission by:<br>Spintronic<br>Goto80<br>Jonny Easton - Menu Music<br><br>Art by:<br>MsMetaFan",
    "about_the_game": "In this unique chat interactive game, your audience matters more than ever! Engage with the action by having your viewers typing commands in the chat, and watch as their decisions directly impact the on-screen gameplay. Will you march on the path to victory or have a wrench thrown in your plans? The choice is up to chat!<br><br>But beware, every adventure comes with risks. Viewers responsible might face consequences. It's a high-stakes challenge where skill, strategy, and a bit of mischief collide. Chatters can be timed out, banned, VIP'd and so much more! This game is built around taking your TikTok, YouTube, or Twitch stream to the next level!<br><br>Collaborate, compete, and share unforgettable moments together as we push the boundaries of interactive streaming!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/0dd7ac0b7ad447114192b3db70ad9ebd.avif?t=1738477316\" /></span><br><br>The game can be played by audiences of any size! As a streamer, take command and watch your chat have the time of their life right in front of your very eyes!<br><br>This game is meant to be a fun experience for both streamers and viewers that would like to more actively participate. The game is very community oriented and is meant to be fun for all. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/Peepoheart__1_.png?t=1738477316\" /></span><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udfae Engaging Gameplay: Type commands in the chat to influence the game in real-time and interact with the streamer on screen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/72cc8b4102e3fda8251cc887f03c0805.poster.avif?t=1738477316\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/72cc8b4102e3fda8251cc887f03c0805.webm?t=1738477316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/72cc8b4102e3fda8251cc887f03c0805.mp4?t=1738477316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>\ud83d\udd25 Viewer Impact: Your decisions directly affect the outcome, creating a truly interactive experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/aecd18900b60c7fd6e6ee4c4d5ef58eb.poster.avif?t=1738477316\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/aecd18900b60c7fd6e6ee4c4d5ef58eb.webm?t=1738477316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538580/extras/aecd18900b60c7fd6e6ee4c4d5ef58eb.mp4?t=1738477316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>\u2694\ufe0f High-Stakes: Failure has consequences!</li></ul><br>Fantastic Music used with permission by:<br>Spintronic<br>Goto80<br>Jonny Easton - Menu Music<br><br>Art by:<br>MsMetaFan",
